# Vouchcode local state.
#
# The ledger is local, per-clone provenance state, not a shared source artifact. It is
# untracked deliberately: the post-commit hook writes it after each commit, so a tracked
# ledger would leave the working tree dirty immediately after every commit. The portable,
# shareable proof is the signed report produced by the reporting layer, not this file.
.vouchcode/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/

# Tooling
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Editor and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code workspace configuration and installed skills.
#
# Untracked deliberately. These are development-environment settings rather than part
# of the product, and the project keeps its tooling trail out of the public repository.
# CLAUDE.md itself is tracked, because the engineering rules it carries apply to any
# contributor and must survive a fresh clone.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md